I've been thinking more about this, and instead of creating a new,
worthless item like beeswax, why not just bend the rules a little bit
and have it use royal jelly? It's a waxy/honey substance, but more
importantly, it's a rare commodity that's worth something (strength),
and so unless the player is already maxed out on strength, creating a
simple candle with it would be a loss to the player and would only make
sense to do in an emergency situation. Reading a confused ?oLight would
turn all of the royal jelly in your main inventory into wax candles --
that definitely fits more along the paradigms that are already in place
in the game.

I would certainly like to see this added -- if not to Vanilla, at least
to Slash'em, though I think it's a great yani.



